icio, ese que consiste en conocer la experiencia física del espacio; la luz, los materiales puros, las texturas, el silencio y la conciencia del sitio que se va a habitar. Su vocación estética es una invitación a la pausa y, por lo tanto, a la introspección.","imageSrc":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#080808","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/38341/ad-100-2026.jpg","srcSet":"/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/47530/ad-100-2026.jpg 125w,\n/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/a58a3/ad-100-2026.jpg 250w,\n/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/38341/ad-100-2026.jpg 500w,\n/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/53bad/ad-100-2026.jpg 1000w","sizes":"(min-width: 500px) 500px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/6a09b/ad-100-2026.webp 125w,\n/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/00c70/ad-100-2026.webp 250w,\n/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/15486/ad-100-2026.webp 500w,\n/static/48f8832120cb33fc7f839abbfdd0c4f6/b328c/ad-100-2026.webp 1000w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 500px) 500px, 100vw"}]},"width":500,"height":625}}},"variant":"article","embeddedImages":null,"fullArticle":"https://www.admagazine.com/articulos/ad100-2026"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Yinji Space","month":11,"year":2025,"slug":"yinji-space-2025","excerpt":"It’s not just a workspace—it’s a way of responding to the present with honesty, rhythm, and care.","imageSrc":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/e1ec452b282aa52b78a0d189b3217089/46e4b/yinjispace_cover.jpg","srcSet":"/static/e1ec452b282aa52b78a0d189b3217089/553d3/yinjispace_cover.jpg 125w,\n/static/e1ec452b282aa52b78a0d189b3217089/eec6d/yinjispace_cover.jpg 250w,\n/static/e1ec452b282aa52b78a0d189b3217089/46e4b/yinjispace_cover.jpg 500w,\n/static/e1ec452b282aa52b78a0d189b3217089/817a6/yinjispace_cover.jp